            "kind": "NO_CODE_CHANGE",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/include/worker.hpp",
                    "line": 536,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "SunnySrivastava",
                        "email": "sunnsr25@in.ibm.com",
                        "username": "SunnySrivastava1984"
                    },
                    "message": "Why we need an API for this? Just a condition check, why this can't be done in place?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/include/worker.hpp",
                    "line": 536,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Souvik Roy",
                        "email": "souvikroyofficial10@gmail.com",
                        "username": "souvik1914581"
                    },
                    "message": "This condition needs to be checked at multiple places. Also, we plan to optimize the logic of using \"synthesized\" and \"handlePresence\" tag to determine whether vpd-manager needs to handle the Present property of the FRU, in the future.\nHaving this condition as an inline method makes the code more readable and maintainable."
